{"title":"Earth Science","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>As stated in the name, Earth Science is the study of the earth and it's atmosphere. It is everything from the Golgi Apparatus to the Energy Pyramid Cycle. Inside Earth Science there are also many topics too such as Oceanography, Meteorology, Geology, and much much more.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183254\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.001 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.001 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16923:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183254 and revision id 99045. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}